LargeLetter: {
	DisplayName: Large Letter

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: You could say things have been going... smoothl-E...
		NoHome: Dude you gotta help me man. I lost my life savings. I'm on the streets. You gotta help me man.
		FarFromHome: Dude where the hell am I? How'd I get here? Where's my house?
		LoveSpace: Ah, peace and quiet sure is nice...
		DislikeCrowded: Is it getting packed here or it just me?
		HateCrowded: Who the hell are all these people man.
		LikeNPC_Princess: It's part of my housing contract that I legally have to like being around {NPCName}. She's fine I guess.
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is quite the 'character'. They have quite the collection!"
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName} is one of my chums. We're a little different from the rest."
		HateNPC: Dude. Isn't that {NPCName} guy like, super racist? Who even invited him? He said he wanted to 'kill all goblins'. That's messed up, dude!
	}

	Census.SpawnCondition: In Expert Mode
	Button1: Vanity Shop
	Button2: Weapon Shop
	Chat1: Hope you don't mind me hanging around. I had to deal with a LOT of bad code to get here. Could do with a break.
	Chat2:
		'''
		A fun fact? Hmm, well I've never met my father. They say he vanished a long time ago. He's a real...
		Mr. E.
		'''
	Chat3: You're looking for a fish? No clue who you're talking about, pal.
	Chat4: Look at me! I'm Big E! I've always been here, and I'll always be!
}

Legendscribe: {
	Census.SpawnCondition: Always Available
	DisplayName: Legendscribe

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I'm cool as a cucumber.
		NoHome: Man, having wandered the desert for so long... A house would be a nice change of pace.
		FarFromHome: I'm putting up missing dog posters... They're for me...
		LoveSpace: It's nice to be able to kick back and relax with all this space.
		DislikeCrowded: It's a bit noisy hear. I just want to read this really good book.
		HateCrowded: It's so cramped. You'vr basically got me living in a kennel!
		LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName}'s heart is certainly lighter than a feather."
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} has so many stories to share!"
		LoveBiome: Ah, nothing like the desert sun to help get a nice tan!
		HateBiome: I'm f-f-freezing! Get me back someplace w-w-warm, please!
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName}'s been helping clean off my fleas."
		DislikeNPC: This {NPCName} guy keeps golfing in my desert!
	}

	AnubisName: Legendscribe
	SetChatButtons1: Switch Info
	SetChatButtons2: What Do I do now?
	SetChatButtons3: Mushrooms. I'm serious.
	SetChatButtons4: More Mushrooms.
	SetChatButtons5: Get a Grip
	SetChatButtons6: Deadweight Dragon
	SetChatButtons7: Three-Headed Freak
	SetChatButtons8: 3 Wishes
	SetChatButtons9: Cool as Ice
	SetChatButtons10: Gotcha'
	SetChatButtons11: Mechanical Mass
	SetChatButtons12: Two heads; zero brains
	SetChatButtons13: More worm bosses god dammit.
	SetChatButtons14: Ancient of Judgement
	SetChatButtons15: Terrible Twins
	SetChatButtons16: Ancient of Fury
	SetChatButtons17: Ancient of Wrath
	SetChatButtons18: Ancient of Doom
	SetChatButtons19: Discordian Doomsayer
	SetChatButtons20: The Stonekeepers
	SetChatButtons21: Squakin' Headache
	SetChatButtons22: What a Worm
	SetChatButtons23: Hopping Hoodlum
	SetChatButtons24: Harpy Hags are back
	SetChatButtons25: Riches and R.I.P. you
	SetChatButtons26: Wrath of the Wabbit
	SetChatButtons27: I demand a rematch.
	GetBookChat:
		'''
		You got it! My limited edition copy of my esteemed biogrophy! Thanks, pal. You know what? As a gift, you can have it. Here, I'll even autograph it for you.
		...Whoops, I accidentally used my runic quill to sign it. Oh well, now it's magic.
		'''
	GetSummonItemChat: Hey, thanks for getting back to me. I wanna test your strength. After you thrashed those mechanical meatheads, I'm interested in seeing how you fair against someone like me. Here, take this scepter and go use it in the desert on the surface whenever you're ready. I'm ready whenever.
	GetSummonItemChat2: Take this. It's an old artifact that will come in handy soon. It should direct you towards a...special place to the people of this world. read the plaques there. They'll tell you what to do. We got some work to do if we want to clear out some of the major evils in the world.
	CombatTextChat: I'm headed home. Peace.
	downedMonarchY: ...that was it?
	downedMonarchN: Hey, you know all these little red mushrooms growing everywhere? I hear if you squish a bunch of them together and wave them around, their king or something will come and attempt to run you down. I gotta see that.
	downedFungusY: Nice work. Now be honest, how high are you right now?
	downedFungusN: The glowing mushroom caves always make me feel loopy for some reason. Anyways, you want better magic abilities? There's a big mushroom monster that has some great magic abilities infused into it. Just plug your nose while your down there.
	downedGripsY: Nice job taking down those giant hands. Maybe the little ones will finally leave me alone for once.
	downedGripsN: Those flying claws at night are a nightmare to deal with, and they freak me out. In my travels, I've come across these two REEEEEEEEALLY big ones. Maybe if you kill them, the little ones will bugger off. Maybe killing a few of them and showing that you have in some way will call them down.
	downedBroodY: That was the fattest dragon I've ever seen in my life.
	downedBroodN: Like dragons? No? Too bad. You want better gear? You gotta go kill of this HUGE dragon made of lava. She's big, scary, and WAAAAAAAAAAAY too fat to fly, but she does anyways.
	downedHydraY: Good riddance. That hydra can't seem to lay off. At least her daughter is a bit more mellow...huh? Who? I'll explain later, good job.
	downedHydraN: The Mire has always been a gathering spot for all the nastiest lizards, but there's a really big one there, and it's got 3 heads. She's really grouchy all the time, and any time I try to go into her den, she tries to EAT me!
	downedDjinnY: Hah! Who's tough now you sandy sadsack!
	downedDjinnN: THAT SON OF A-- Oh hi. Sorry, I was just a bit angry about a little tussle I had with desert djinn. That magical meathead and his goons need to stop flexing their muscles on me. Could you go teach em' a thing or two?
	downedSerpentY: Hope you didn't get any 'FROSTBITES'! *buh-dum-tish* ...yeah I know that was lame.
	downedSerpentN: Snakes, why does it always have to be snakes? I hate 'em! Whatever, in the tundra recently, there have been these snow snerpents that won't leave me alone. Could ya play exterminator and find out what they're doing?
	downedRetrieverY: Did you get my 3rd edition of 'The Life and Epic Adventures of Anubis the Wonder Dog!' back by any chance?
	downedRetrieverN: Remember the Grips of Chaos? Those nasty grabby hands? There's a robotic one and it keeps stealing my stuff. Can you do me a favor and go throw a wrench at it or something?
	downedRaiderY: So it was a giant robot after all? Well, sometimes people just overthinking the problem. That thing was almost as fat as the Broodmother.
	downedRaiderN: People said that they saw strange shade in one of the nights. It was so big that it even closed the moon for a moment. You should discover this mystery and do something.
	downedOrthrusY: I guess orthrus is what it eats, now.
	downedOrthrusN: Remeber the Hydra? There's a bigger one out there. And it's a robot. And it uh...shoots lightning. So uh...good luck!
	downedEquinoxY: Nice job taking out the Equinox worms. I could tell you did because it's like a week later now. I hope I didn't miss my nurse's appointment...
	downedEquinoxN: Like worms? Me neither, but guess what? There are 2 big ones that control the flow of day and night, and they're tough buggers. Good luck.
	AnubisScapterLost: You LOST the scepter?! I can't go handing these things out like candy, you know! Anyways, here's another one.
	downedAnubisBY: You could have gone a little easier on me, ya know. My back still hurts from that.
	downedAnubisBN: I hear there’s this lorekeeper guy that’s really jacked and handsome, and all the ladies love him for his amazing soul-judging abilities. What a guy.
	downedAthenaY: Thank the Equinox, you shut those annoying little squakers up! I was about to roast one of them over a spit and have fried chicken for dinner if they shrieked at me one more time.
	downedAthenaN: You know those screechin' harpies up in the sky? Well there are these REALLY obnoxious ones called seraphs who just WILL NOT SHUT UP!!! They have a leader in that sky palace to the east. Maybe if you give her the ol' one-two, they'll shut their yappers.
	downedGreedYBookY: Hey thanks for getting my book back. Greed stole it a while ago, probably because of the gold highlights I used to bind it. Look around that cave, maybe there's some other stuff he's stolen?
	downedGreedYBookN: Hey uh...did you find my thing yet? No? Just dig around in that loot pile down there, I'm sure it's there somewhere.
	downedGreedN: Hey uh, there's this HUGE hoard of treasure underground somewhere with lots of gold in it, but it's guarded by this really stingy worm. You should go check it out for a boatload of booty, but uh...there's something of mine down there. Could you go get it for me? Don't worry, when you see it, you'll know it's mine.
	downedRajahY: You bested Rajah? Pft, yeah right, I've seen him trounce supposed gods before, there's no way you beat him..!
	downedRajahN: Hey, you know those bunnies that hop around all the time? I uh... I wouldn't harass them if I were you. There's a legend around here of a sort of 'Guardian' of sorts that protects from the danger. Why is it a legend? Because apparently nobody has fought this thing and lived. Neat story, eh?
	downedAnubisFAnubisY: You did good, pal. I'm pretty impressed, even though I was still holding back. Huh? My full power..? Like I said earlier, some things should stay locked away for your own good.
	downedAnubisFAnubisN: I want a rematch, {0}. Not because of my pride, either. I need to make sure you're ready for what's ahead. Meet me in the desert and fight again. And be ready.

	UnofficialInterim: {
		Help: Sorry, bud, but until you prove yourself by beating me, I won't be offering anymore help.
		PreFight.Repeat: I'm afraid this is something that can't wait. Unless you're able to prove you're ready for what's to come, I won't be helping you any further.

		PostLose: {
			First: Tough luck, bud. You're gonna need more than that if you want to face what lies ahead. Don't worry, I'll be up for another rematch whenever you're ready!

			Repeat: {
				FirstDeath: {
					0: Why not give fighting me another go? Your only chance to proceed is through beating me.
					1: Don't tell me you're willing to quit after one lose. C'mon, let's go for a round two!
				}

				MultipleDeaths: {
					0: Your tenacity's strong, but tenacity alone won't be enough for what's to come. C'mon, let's go again!
					1: That was a good try, bud. Keep at it. I don't doubt you'll prove youself to me.
				}
			}
		}

		PostVictory: Haha! Now that was something else! I knew you had it in you. I've got no doubt you're ready to face what lies ahead.
	}

	downedAthenaAY: Huh? What's a Varian you ask? That's something I haven't heard in years...so long ago that I barely even remember the name. Although I do recall something about another one kicking around somewhere...
	downedAthenaAN: Hey, did that annoying little witch find you? Sorry for telling her where you were, she wouldn't stop screeching in my ear. Anyways, looks like Athena wants a rematch. Stay on your guard, bud. This seems like a trap...
	GreedACalamityMod: Ya know, you duking it out with the Devourer of Gods reminded me of Greed a bit...I mean think about it. They both have wormhole capabilities and they both adapt to what they eat. Could they possibly be...nah, that'd be rediculous...or..?
	downedGreedAY: So he WAS hiding his true power all along. I wonder why, though...could he be hiding from something, perhaps..?
	downedGreedAN: You know, I seem to remember a story about ol' grabby-mc-steal-your-crap. When he first showed up in these parts, he was much stronger than he was when you kicked his rear end. Maybe he got weaker as time went on..? Or maybe...nah, that couldn't be it.
	downedSistersY: Nice, you taught those two spoiled brats a lesson! Those two didn't see it coming!
	downedSistersN: Remember ol' Brood and Hydra? Well, those two have daughters. And MAN they're annoying..! Every time I go into the chaos biomes, those two are just waiting to ruin my day! Can you go give em' the ol' one-two?
	downedAkumaY: Akuma thinks he's edgy. To me, he just comes across as trying to be way too cool and failing. Anyways, might wanna run some water through your hair. You got a little singed up there.
	downedAkumaN: Why would anyone call a sun serpent a demon? I have no idea personally...but Akuma has got to go. He always glasses my deserts with his flame breath and it pisses me off.
	downedYamataY: Thanks for shutting up that 7-headed sissy. He makes me want to tear my fur out.
	downedYamataN: Yamata, the whiny nit! He complains about everything, and he WONT SHUT UP! LIKE SERIOUSLY, YOU try and deal with seven obnoxiously loud dragon heads that chatter constantly and talk over eachother!
	downedZeroY: ...I'll be honest. I don't like what that thing said after it died one bit.
	downedZeroN: You know the void? Those spooky floating islands to the east? There's a BIG scary machine there that's always just floating there. Anyways, after you slammed the moon lord, I heard a massive shockwave come from the void. Could you check it out for me?
	downedShenY: Holy-- I knew you had it in you, man! Awesome job! Although...he seemed pretty angry when you beat him...almost as angry as when he got beat by-- er, nevermind that.
	downedShenN: Akuma and Yamata...you know, those two were once one being. And hot dang, that guy was powerful. He leveled 2 civilizations one time. Anyways, so what was it that you needed?
	downedRajahCY: So ol' Rajah finally decided to hang up the scepter? Seems like he thought you were the right pick to protect those in need. I'd do what he says. It's the right thing to do, in my opinion.
	downedRajahCN: Them bunnies have been getting pretty riled up lately. Something ain't right. I just feel it...
	Stones: You know...after you whooped ol' Shen, I felt some...very old magic activate. Maybe you should pay a visit to some of the tougher bosses you've come across? By the way, have you seen the Goblin Summoner recently? Jeeze she got tough. Wonder what her deal is.
	else: I dunno? Ask me about any strong creatures you can fight currently.
	AkumaGuideChat: If I were you, I'd stay out of the Mire during the day. It gets really foggy and you can't see jack squat in there. I think you can make a lantern out of blaze claws if I remember correctly to help see through it...
	YamataGuideChat: The Volcano in the inferno gets pretty active at night for some reason. During the day, it seems to calm down. Maybe you could get through if you made some kind of cover out of those Hydra claws? They seem to not be affected by that ash...
	JungleGuideChat: Creatures in the jungle drop these really weird leaves I've noticed. They're tough as nails, though, so making gear out of it could be a pretty interesting idea...
	BroodMotherGuideChat: You know those eggs at the bottom of the inferno volcano? Yeah uh, I wouldn't touch those if I were you, unless you want to deal with a very angry dragon.
	HydraGuideChat: Underneath the lake in the mire are some pods of...something. I don't really want to know what that Hydra thing eats. I wouldn't break them either, that lizard gets feisty when something messes with her food.
	VoidGuideChat: Those floating islands to the east freak me out. They're just...there. I think there's some houses on them, but I'm not going up there.
	HardModeGuideChat1: Hey, if you go to the underground chaos biomes, I think you can get some souls like the ones you get in the evil biomes. Those should be useful.
	HardModeGuideChat2: Hey you know those frogs in the mire? I hear they hoard tons of coins. Just go beat the bajeezus out of them and BAM! Cash money.
	PlantBossGuideChat: Did you hear that music coming from the Terrarium? I think there's something new down there. See if you can get your hands on one of those green prisms they have. I think you can make a crazy new crafting station with it.
	EquinoxBossGuideChat: You know those glowing spheres in the sky? If I remember correctly, they change depending on the time of day. Maybe you can get something different from them if you go at different points in the day?
	AnubisChatMask: Hey, lookin' good handsome.
	AnubisChat1: You wouldn’t happen to be good at belly rubs would you?
	AnubisChat2: You know that awful feeling of getting sand in your swim trunks after going to the beach? Imagine having that all the time. Welcome to my life.
	AnubisChat3: For the thousandth time, I AM NOT A FURRY!
	AnubisChat4: Hey, I got this really bad itch on my back. Could ya get it for me?
	AnubisChat5:
		'''
		No. I won’t wear a flea collar.
			 
		*Scratch Scratch*
		'''
	AnubisChat6: Everyone asks me who's a good boy, but I'm upset because they never tell me who it is.
	AnubisChat7: Have you seen my tail? I need to teach it a thing or two.
	AnubisChat8: The Desert Djinn may be ripped but he's got nothing on me! Check it!
	AnubisChat9: Thanks for letting me crash here by the way. Walking around the desert for a couple thousand years really tuckers ya out.
	AnubisChat10: I wrote the Terraria Historia, yes. But I also wrote another great book. 'The Life and Epic Adventures of Anubis the Wonder Dog!' Want a copy?
	AnubisChat11: "Don't you hate it when "
	AnubisChat12: red fleshy crap
	AnubisChat13: purple muggy crap
	AnubisChat14: " takes over your biome? it's disgusting."
	AnubisChat15: What creature do I hate most? Oh that's easy, King Slime. If that thing lands on you, good luck washing the slime out of your clothes or fur without a blowtorch.
	AnubisChat16: "Geeze, I tried hitting on "
	AnubisChat17: " earlier and they kicked the bajeezus out of me. What is it with these ladies and blood moons?"
	AnubisChat18: "I tried hitting on "
	AnubisChat19: " and she was totally polite to me. That's...odd... especially during a blood moon."
	AnubisChat20: Hey, nice outfit.
	AnubisChat21: Hey, like my floating party hat? Magic is fun.
	AnubisChat22: Disco is still popular with you terrarians, right? I can do a mean boogie.
	AnubisChat23: "Hey uh...if anyone asks, "
	AnubisChat24: " got all of his info from me, got it?"
	AnubisChat25: "That "
	AnubisChat26: " is pretty chill. Knows a lot about bosses too... actually I hope he isn't stalking me or anything."
	AnubisChat27: "I think "
	AnubisChat28: " isn't letting in on how smart he actually is. I mean look at that face. Pure. Raw. Genius."
	AnubisChat29: " keeps yelling at me for eating all the shoes he makes. It's not my fault he makes them with premium lether."
	AnubisChat30: "Don't ask "
	AnubisChat31: " where he gets his merch. It's nasty."
	AnubisChat32: ...and then, he flips it over, and it turns out this guy turned himself into get this; a pickle. Bloody funniest sh*t I've ever seen. Huh? Who am I talking to? I dunno.
	AnubisChatSOTSAnubisMask1: No.
	AnubisChatSOTSAnubisMask2: Stop it.
	AnubisChatSOTSAnubisMask3: Don't talk to me.
	AnubisChatSOTSAnubisMask4: Get away from me.
}

