GoblinSlayer: {
	DisplayName: Goblin Slayer
	Census.SpawnCondition: Goblin Army is defeated

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I sense no goblins nearby. I am at peace.
		NoHome: Not having a place to story my goblin-slaying weapons is rough. Can you help?
		FarFromHome: I've been away from home for too long. We could've been raided by goblins!
		LoveSpace: I prefer to be alone. Makes spotting goblins easier.
		DislikeCrowded: Some of these people.. They, they don't mind goblins. This can't stand.
		HateCrowded: There's goblins hiding amongst this crowd... I know it!!
		LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} isn't a goblin. I respect that."
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} may be racist, but I love everyone in my kingdom, so I guess that's okay."
		LikeBiome: Not a goblin to be seen in this peaceful forest. Wonderful.
		DislikeBiome: I've seen goblin scouts lurking about the coastline. We need to kill them.
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName} is also familiar with goblin slaying. Very good."
		HateNPC: I NEED TO KILL THAT GOBLIN.
	}

	GoblinSlayerName: Goblin Slayer
	GoblinSlayerChat1: "I don't trust "
	GoblinSlayerChat2: . There's just something about him that I don't like...
	GoblinSlayerChat3: " tells me that where he's from, they kill goblins a lot. I wish to visit this place sometime. Sounds glorious."
	GoblinSlayerChat4: I don't like goblins.
	GoblinSlayerChat5: Seen any goblins I can kill?
	GoblinSlayerChat6: Goblins are a scourge on this earth.
	GoblinSlayerChat7: Find any good goblin dens to raid?
	GoblinSlayerChat8: Why do I hate goblins? Because they're goblins.
	GoblinSlayerChat9: Hey, while you're out there, can you kill some goblins for me? Give me their souls and I'll trade you for some of my extra goblin slaying gear.
	GoblinSlayerChat10: Souka.
	GoblinSlayerChat11: There are other armies invading this land like those dreaded goblins. Fortunately, beating the snot out of those little twerps has prepared me. Bring me some special things from them and I'll give you some of the stuff I've picked up from them.
}

Lovecraftian: {
	Census.SpawnCondition: Eye of Cthulhu defeated
	DisplayName: Lovecraftian

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I'm adjusting to life in this dimension.
		NoHome: I'd like a place I can do my research in.
		FarFromHome: I miss my research...
		LoveSpace: I'm glad I have this place to myself. My research can get... dangerous, for your kind.
		DislikeCrowded: Yeesh, it's a bit hard to focus with how crowded it is.
		HateCrowded: There's way too many people here. Its impeding my research!
		LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is so welcoming! She's even willing to assist me!"
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is just so curious about us! It's endearing"
		LoveBiome: I feel so at home here in the Ocean. It's about as close as your dimension gets being like in mine.
		DislikeBiome: Yeesh, think I could live somewhere else? I'm drying out in this sun!
		LikeNPC: "{NPCName} has been so helpful in learning about your dimension."
		DislikeNPC: I'm not fond of {NPCName}. Any time I ask him something, he always tries to charge me for his answer!
	}

	button1: Shop
	button2: Supply Ingredients
	LovecraftianChat1: You know, where I’m from, I’m what your world would call ‘hot stuff.’
	LovecraftianChat2: I wasn’t the only thing that came here. A whole bunch of other stuff came through with me when a spacial rift opened up in my world. Stuff like the Eye of Cthulhu and the Brain of Cthulhu were already here though. No clue where those two came from.
	LovecraftianChat3: ...What are you looking at? You act like you've never seen a squid-person before.
	LovecraftianChat4: Yes I’m a woman. What about it? Is it the tentacle beard that threw you off?
	LovecraftianChat5: If you have any sense of self preservation, I’d avoid that sunken ship in the ocean just off the coast. Scary things from my neck of the woods hang out there, especially... nevermind.
	LovecraftianChat6: Ever just find things in your tentacles that you don’t know how they got there? No? Just me?
	LovecraftianChat7: Hey, your world is pretty interesting. Could you bring me some samples from different biomes for me to study? If you do, I can make some neat stuff to trade with you.
	LovecraftianChat8: "Oh. This is awkward. Poor "
	LovecraftianChat9: . His ship was the one that got destroyed when I fell out of that rift.
	LovecraftianChat10: "That "
	LovecraftianChat11: " is talking out of his ass. Cthulhu would most likely squash him before he could even say *ech*."
	LovecraftianChat12: That dead guy shambling around freaks me out, and that’s saying something considering I’m a walking horror story. I don’t know, I just feel like he knows too much...
	LovecraftianChat13: Fun fact; The Moon Lord and Cthulhu are brothers. At least that’s what some pink pixie lady I met one time told me.
	PurityFlaskChat: Oh! Are those purity shards? Perfect! Here, take this. You can purify most biomes with this special flask I made.
	AshJarChat: Dragons, eh? I've seen scarier. Anyways, here's a new flask. Careful, it's hot.
	DarkwaterFlaskChat: What is this..? It's literally a ball of...something. I'm gonna look into it. Here, new flask. Go crazy.
	CorruptionFlaskChat: Why are you gagging? There are things that smell way worse than this. It's only decomposing flesh.
	CrimsonFlaskChat: Hm...bones? I've seen ones like these before. Similar to ones from where I came.
	HallowFlaskChat: What is this stuff? It's...sparkly..? Whatever, I'll research it a bit more. Here's a new flask.
	VoidFlaskChat: Wow this is heavy! What is this? I've never seen this kind of metal before. Oh right. New flask. Here.
	FungicideChat: Hmm...glowing spores? I've never seen something like this aside from glowing mushrooms. Speaking of mushrooms, here, I found a recipe for some really good fungicide. I made it into a flask.
	SporeSacChat: What is this stuff? It's so squishy...I'll make it work I guess. Oh by the way, (0) showed me how to make mushroom spores. Feel free to use it how you see fit.
	SporeSacMushmanNameFallback: someone I talked to earlier
	GlowingSporeSacChat: Hm, this stuff is pretty glowy. *Sniff* Yowza that burns my nostrils. Anyways, here, I made a glowing version of {0}'s spores.
	GlowingSporeSacMushmanNameFallback: a fun guy
	JungleFlaskChat: Oh thank you so much! These stingers will work nicely for some makeshift syringes. Here, I've developed a brand new solution that changes forest into jungle. Nifty, huh?
	IceFlaskChat: Now THIS will come in handy. Thank you. Hey, speaking of ice, check this out. Snow creation AND removal flasks? You like it? Two for the price of one!
	ForestFlaskChat: I wish we had these back where I came from. They're adorable~! Oh, but I'd be careful with these little guys if I were you. The dryad told me there's some giant monster that protects them...anyways, while you were out, I made a new flask. It turns Jungle into forest. Careful with it.
	SquidListChat: Here's a list of some things I need for my research. If you lose it, I'll happily write up a new one for you
	NothingChat: Hmm...nothing? I need stuff to study. I'd like some important materials from biomes. Monster pieces, plants, etc.
}

Mushman: {
	Census.SpawnCondition: After defeating Mushroom Monarch, build a house in a red mushroom biome
	DisplayName: Mushman

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: I'm just a humble shroom in the wind...
		NoHome: I could use a place to grow more of my special shrooms...
		FarFromHome: Oh crap, my shrooms! Are they okay without me?!
		LoveSpace: Ah, my shrooms have so much space to grow!
		DislikeCrowded: My poor shrooms, there're feeling quite cramped.
		HateCrowded: SOMEONE has been STEALING my shrooms! With all these people here, I don't know who!
		LikeNPC_Princess: "{NPCName} is as big a fan of red mushrooms as me!"
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is also a really fun guy!"
		LoveBiome: Ah, I love the sight of red mushrooms in the morning!
		HateBiome: Eugh, BLUE mushrooms?! This sucks.
		LikeNPC: I like {NPCName}. She really knows how to party!
		HateNPC: "{NPCName} is just such a downer."
	}

	button1: Shop
	button2: Strange Plants
	MushmanChat1: Those glowing truffles are all just such downers.
	MushmanChat2: " offered to let me get in his hot tub one time. I denied because I had better things to do"
	MushmanChat3: The Mushroom Monarch isn't all he seems, you know.
	MushmanChat4: Don't ask where I get the mushrooms for my potions.
	MushmanChat5: I got potions, you got money. Wanna trade?
	MushmanChat6: " asked me one time if red truffles tasted as good as blue ones. Obviously not. Blue truffles are way saltier."
	NoMushroomChat1: I need strange plants for something. Bring me some and I'll give you some special alchemical mushrooms. Good for making potions.
	NoMushroomChat2: ...no plants?
	NoMushroomChat3: Plants please. I won't give you mushrooms without them.
	SpecialChat1: A Madness Mushroom? Sweet! Here's a special kind mushroom for payment. This one is really useful. Just...don't eat it directly.
	SpecialChat2: Oh, a Madness Mushroom! These ones I like a lot because of their special properties. Here, have a few rainbow shrooms.
	SpecialChat3: You can find these in both mushroom biomes, you know. Make sure to check both of them just in case. They're really useful.
	MushroomChat1: Thank you. These mushrooms are way more useful than worthless dyes, am I right?
	MushroomChat2: Here. More colored mushrooms for all your brewing needs. Just...don't eat them.
	MushroomChat3: What do I use these dye materials for? Uh...things. Now leave me be, I have stuff to do!
}

Samurai: {
	Census.SpawnCondition: Grips of Chaos defeated
	DisplayName: Samurai

	TownNPCMood: {
		Content: Happiness is a direction, not a destination.
		NoHome: I need a place to rest and hone my steel if I'm ever to best that beast...
		FarFromHome: I am too far from home.
		LoveSpace: The quiet helps me focus better on my training.
		DislikeCrowded: A bit more quiet would really help me focus.
		HateCrowded: How am I meant to train with so many people around?! I might lop someone's head off!
		LikeNPC_Princess: If a nation is to rise from the ashes of what came before, I trust {NPCName} to lead it.
		Princess_LovesNPC: "{NPCName} is so skilled with their sword!"
		LikeBiome: Even in its... chaotic state, I love my homeland.
		DislikeBiome: Eugh, this place is just teeming with insects...
		LikeNPC: I've talked a lot with {NPCName}. It seems he'd be a valuable ally in my hunt.
		DislikeNPC: I'm not really a fan of {NPCName}'s ale. I prefer Sake to be entirely honest.
	}

	SamuraiChat1: "I've known "
	SamuraiChat2: " for a while. He's quite the man of culture."
	SamuraiChat3: "I'm not really a fan of "
	SamuraiChat4: "'s ale. It's a bit strong for my taste. I prefer Sake to be entirely honest."
	SamuraiChat5: The Chaos biomes weren't always so.... err.... chaotic.
	SamuraiChat6: Have you seen my sword? I can't seem to find it anywhere.
	SamuraiChat7: We used to be the most powerful nation in all of terraria... then... HE came...
	SamuraiChat8: I remember my old master giving me wise words such as: 'YOU ARE TRYING TO VIEW FLASH CONTENT BUT YOU DO NOT HAVE A FLASH PLAYER INSTALLED'... I’m still trying to figure that one out.
	SamuraiChat9: I'll be honest, I get half my lines from fortune cookies. Want one?
	SamuraiChat10: If you refuse to accept anything but the best, you very often get it.
	SamuraiChat11: Change can hurt, but it leads a path to something better.
	SamuraiChat12: You cannot love life until you live the life you love.
	SamuraiChat13: Land is always on the mind of a flying bird.
	SamuraiChat14: Our deeds determine us, as much as we determine our deeds.
	SamuraiChat15: Never give up. You're not a failure if you don't give up.
	SamuraiChat16: You already know the answer to the questions lingering inside your head.
	SamuraiChat17: It is now, and in this world, that we must live.
	SamuraiChat18: You can make your own happiness.
	SamuraiChat19: If winter comes, can spring be far behind?
	SamuraiChat20: A stranger is a friend you have not spoken to yet.
	SamuraiChat21: Your shoes will make you happy today.
}

LuciferSitting: {
	DisplayName: Lucifer the Pit Lord

	Buttons: {
		Who: Who are you?
		When: When will it be done?
		Why: Why are you building it?
		Bye: Alright, goodbye.
	}

	Dialogue: {
		Start:
			'''
			Come back later. I'm setting up shop here.

			Huh? What am I doin'?! I'm supervising.
			'''
		Chat0: Who am I?! I'm-- Who am I kiddin'. You know who I am. Now skedaddle, I got an arena to get built.
		Chat1: I don't know, whenever my guys get off their lazy behinds and actually start building stuff.
		Chat2: You have a lot of questions, don't you? I'm building it because I want to watch guts spill. Why else?
		Chat3: See you around. Come back when I finish, I'd love to see you get gored! BWAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAH!!!
	}
}

QuestFish: {
	Fishmother: Okay so, I was walking through the Inferno looking for something hot for one of my epic pranks, when I saw this fat fish underwater, boiling the water around it. I thought 'PERFECT!' but I couldn't catch it because I didn't have my rod on me. Go get it, slave.
	FishmotherLocation: Caught anywhere in the Inferno
	TriHeadedKoi: I hate the Mire. I can't see a thing in there unless it's past my bedtime, but I know there's a killer fish in there that I want that has, get this, THREE HEADS. Can you go get it for me?
	TriHeadedKoiLocation: Caught anywhere in the Mire
	GlitchFish: I once woke up and saw a strange fish in the water of the scary island over my head in the sky, probably in the West. You go, get it for me. You ask why there are waters in sky island? Find your own way.
	GlitchFishLocation: Caught anywhere in the Void
}
